<BaseLayout
  title="Looped LLMs: Thinking in Circles | Heji Study"
  description="A study of looped LLMs — transformers that route a layer's output back as its own input to revise, refine, and reason. From Universal Transformers to the 2026 renaissance."
  crumb="Looped LLMs"
>

