<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt">#   begin / loop(mid) / end + matrix-valued residual</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt">#   → ~50% fewer params, depth-matched</span></span>
<span class="cs-line cmt">#</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># expressivity ceiling (Saunshi 2502.17416):</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-a"><span class="cmt">#   k×L loops ≈ kL layers, but fixed-size state</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-a"><span class="cmt">#   cannot match poly-length CoT on P-complete tasks</span></span>
</pre>
