<span class="cs-line cmt"># §05 — training-free looping (2605.23872)</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># key: a pre-norm block is ONE Euler step of an ODE</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt">#</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># naive (α=1) — overshoots, DEGRADES</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-a">h = F_theta(h)        <span class="cmt"># one big step, S times</span></span>
